    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks but i'm kinda dreading the doctor thing lol. i've been so busy and i honestly feel like it's just because i haven't been sleeping enough and i'm drinking way too much coffee to get through the week. do you think it could just be caffeine jitters or sleep deprivation making my head feel all fuzzy like that?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
