      "content": "Excessive caffeine and lack of sleep can definitely contribute to feelings of mental fog and irritability. It's important to recognize the impact of caffeine and work on developing healthier habits. However, consulting with a healthcare professional is still advised because persistent symptoms could also have underlying health issues. In the meantime, try to moderate your caffeine intake, aim for consistent sleep patterns, and practice relaxation techniques to help alleviate stress. These measures may improve your cognitive function, but please don't overlook the value of professional advice.",
      "source": "target",
